SUMMARY:Part Closure: BARONS COURT STATION: From Monday 6 July until 
 November\, westbound trains will not call at Barons Court. If travelling 
 westbound from the station\, please use eastbound District or Piccadilly 
 line trains and change to westbound services at West Kensington (on the 
 District line) or Earls Court (on the Piccadilly line) and change to 
 westbound services. If travelling westbound to the station\, please 
 continue to Hammersmith and change for eastbound District or Piccadilly 
 line trains.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
